    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myst of Proph</strong> is a pixel art Metroidvania based on biblical prophecies, health, and parkour. Developed by KeizhGd using the Game Maker Studio engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows <strong>Nic\u00f3s</strong>, a young man nearing his investiture as an explorer. After falling unconscious in the forest, he wakes up several days later weakened, overweight, and with his skills lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring his village, he accidentally activates an ancient machine that triggers an earthquake. His younger brother, <strong>Kokk\u00ed</strong>, falls into a pit along with a mysterious creature. From there, Nic\u00f3s embarks on a journey to follow his brother\u2019s trail through abandoned mines and dark passageways, uncovering a hidden past that the adults had kept secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you\u2019ll learn about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biblical numerology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient prophecies and future events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour techniques and movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The impact of physical health on your abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myst of Proph</strong> is a unique blend of exploration, combat, spiritual learning, and platforming, with a strong narrative focus and a retro visual style.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myst of Proph</strong> is a pixel art Metroidvania based on biblical prophecies, health, and parkour. Developed by KeizhGd using the Game Maker Studio engine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story follows <strong>Nic\u00f3s</strong>, a young man nearing his investiture as an explorer. After falling unconscious in the forest, he wakes up several days later weakened, overweight, and with his skills lost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring his village, he accidentally activates an ancient machine that triggers an earthquake. His younger brother, <strong>Kokk\u00ed</strong>, falls into a pit along with a mysterious creature. From there, Nic\u00f3s embarks on a journey to follow his brother\u2019s trail through abandoned mines and dark passageways, uncovering a hidden past that the adults had kept secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the journey, you\u2019ll learn about:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biblical numerology</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient prophecies and future events</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour techniques and movement</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The impact of physical health on your abilities</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Myst of Proph</strong> is a unique blend of exploration, combat, spiritual learning, and platforming, with a strong narrative focus and a retro visual style.</p>",
